{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"a817d0ad3004c90b7ea6fe52a1a5d71b4132ef418eb9a8b16bac9866f6861823"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:bc3cab769143104c2e6c42019d506dd4c30cd72c33ffc3cfcf30ae3ff99080a4","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Gastritis","evidence":"[D14:1 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! I've been missing our chats. I had quite the health scare last weekend - ended up in the ER with a severe stomachache. Turns out, it was gastritis, which was pretty alarming. It was a wake-up call for me to start prioritizing my health, like adopting a more nutritious diet and getting regular exercise. On top of that, my phone's been giving me a hard time, adding to the stress.","itemId":"urn:uuid:cafe8b3a-5c30-5906-9f93-1caee3b79853","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a6cbaaa17aead42adaef7abffe0193a7538ba1725ffab2b3c4d137a834603111","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What digestive issue did Sam experience lately?","referenceAnswer":"Gastritis","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a6cbaaa17aead42adaef7abffe0193a7538ba1725ffab2b3c4d137a834603111"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}